-to find the last day before its projected overflow, and makes the bin mandatory
-then; bins whose projected collection dates coincide are released together, which
-bundles collections onto fewer days. The projection is deterministic rather than
-a Monte Carlo simulation --- no future state is sampled --- so its per-decision
-cost is closer to a closed form than the day-by-day phrasing suggests.
-
